irst the decision, second its two exits, last the refund or store credit choice, which does not change the path\n* Detail and audience: balanced and mixed, drawn for a laptop\n* Zones: Start the return (nodes 1 to 3), Check the order age (4 and 5) and Finish the return (6 to 8)\n* Title: Fernhouse returns\n* Subtitle: how a Fernhouse customer returns an item, from opening the order to the confirmation, and where the 30 day rule stops it\n* Source line: the Fernhouse returns doc, with the left-out items above\n\n**Assumed, and how each gets settled**\n* Decisions and states: item and reason are one screen, the check runs after they are picked, refund or store credit leads to the same label step, and Not eligible is a dead end. Your word, or the doc itself if you send it, settles each\n* Source class: current behavior. Your word settles it, since I have only your quote and not the doc\n\nIs this the right reading of the board?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6723,"cache_read_input_tokens":97867,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6723},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"be7cb716-f706-4a8e-9bc1-66bb6678c54d","uuid":"81816dc8-2135-4814-b163-2b8ec1e45ea7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:04:26.434Z","request_id":"req_011CgRDC67TzSSTTtGYhZpTZ"}
